# Razorkin Needlehead has first strike only during its controller's turn: on Bot2's turn 4 it blocks Bot2's attacking
# Guerrilla Gorilla (2/2) with no first strike, so both deal damage and both die. Bot2's draws on turns 2 and 4 each ping
# Bot2 for 1 (18); Bot1's own turn-3 draw does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Razorkin Needlehead
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
