? Bot2.Life = 18
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot1.Battlefield.Razorkin Needlehead.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Attack(Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Razorkin Needlehead > Guerrilla Gorilla)
